msgstr "Remplace /wp-login.php par une URL personnalisée et bloque l'accès à la page de connexion standard."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:211
msgid "Custom slug"
msgstr "Slug personnalisé"

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:215
msgid "Forgot the slug? Adding define( 'LUMIA_DISABLE_LOGIN_URL', true ); to wp-config.php re-enables wp-login.php."
msgstr "Slug oublié ? Poser define( 'LUMIA_DISABLE_LOGIN_URL', true ); dans wp-config.php réactive wp-login.php."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:230
msgid "Examples: login, signin, admin, etc."
msgstr "Exemples : connexion, login, admin, etc."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:234
