msgstr "Actuellement neutralisee par la constante LUMIA_DISABLE_LOGIN_URL : wp-login.php reste accessible."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:252
msgid "Strengthen the site security by limiting its exposure."
msgstr "Renforcez la sécurité du site en limitant l'exposition."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:260
msgid "Disable XML-RPC."
msgstr "Désactiver XML-RPC."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:261
msgid "XML-RPC is still used by the WordPress mobile app, Jetpack and pingbacks: only turn it off if nothing connects to it."
msgstr "XML-RPC sert encore à l'application mobile WordPress, à Jetpack et aux pingbacks : coupez-le seulement si rien ne s'y connecte."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:264
msgid "Disables the XML-RPC API"
msgstr "Désactive l'API XML-RPC"

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:286
msgid "Prevent user enumeration"
msgstr "Empêcher l'énumération des utilisateurs"

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:287
msgid "Closes the two most used paths, not all of them: the login form still tells an unknown username from a wrong password."
msgstr "Ferme les deux voies les plus utilisées, pas toutes : le formulaire de connexion distingue toujours un identifiant inconnu d'un mot de passe erroné."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:290
msgid "Blocks ?author= requests and REST access to users."
msgstr "Bloque les requêtes ?author= et l'accès REST aux utilisateurs."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:312
msgid "Hide the WordPress version"
msgstr "Masquer la version WordPress"

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:313
msgid "Cosmetic: the version can still be deduced from core files and versioned scripts. Useful against the simplest automated scans, not against a manual inspection."
msgstr "Cosmétique : la version reste déductible des fichiers du cœur et des scripts versionnés. Utile contre les scans automatisés les plus simples, pas contre un examen manuel."

#: includes/Modules/Security/settings-template.php:316
msgid "Removes the WordPress version from the HTTP headers and the generator meta tag."
msgstr "Retire la version WordPress des headers HTTP et du meta generator."

#: includes/Modules/Smtp/BrevoMailer.php:94
